# Environment for the §4 agentic-misalignment (AM) eval and open-ended QA (Phase 4): vLLM serves the
# base model with LoRA adapters, Inspect runs the upstream AM task, Anthropic grades. Separate from
# msm/.venv because vLLM pins its own torch build. Versions: the newest releases at least two weeks
# old when pinned (2026-10-21). Install with `bash scripts/setup_am_env.sh`; recompile the lock with
# `LOCK=1 bash scripts/setup_am_env.sh`.
